  "content_id": "16136213",
  "title": "Cardano ADA Network Fees",
  "description": "Cardano (ADA) Network – Stable and Predictable\nCardano aims for reliability and stability, using a unique transaction fee formula.\nHow ADA...",
  "body": "<h1 id=\"h_01JSZ535HYDBF00N7982SF5RNT\">Cardano (ADA) Network – Stable and Predictable</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">Cardano aims for reliability and stability, using a unique transaction fee formula.</p><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ535HYCCA5WS8X8MPACDGG\">How ADA Fees Work</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Fixed minimum fee + size-based fee</b><br>Paid in <b>ADA tokens</b>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\">Edge handles the calculation behind the scenes for you.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ535HYFA56M8Q5WN7TEBMS\">Fee Options Available</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Automatic calculation</b> — No manual settings needed.</p></li></ul><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ535HYWFV9VA6F247RHKXM\">Average Cost</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Usually <b>$0.10 to $0.20 USD</b> per transaction.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ535HZH43Z80T9Z91DHK1H\">Why It Matters</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Cardano keeps fees predictable even as the network grows. Edge ensures your ADA transactions are fast and cost-effective without any complicated settings.</p>",
